        </div>

        <div class="panel">
          <div class="success-summary-box">
            <div class="success-docket-row">
              <span>Contribution Confirmed</span>
              <span class="receipt" style="margin-bottom: 0; padding: 2px 8px;">
                <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                Docket Verified
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="success-amount-display" id="success-amount"><%= formattedTotal %></div>
            <p class="panel-copy" id="success-cadence" style="margin-bottom: 0;"><%= cadence === 'monthly' ? 'Monthly sustaining sponsorship — cancel anytime' : 'One-time emergency rescue gift' %></p>
          </div>

          <div class="gift-purpose">
            <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path d="M16 28V12M16 20C4 20 4 6 4 6s12 0 12 14ZM16 15C16 5 28 5 28 5s0 10-12 10Z"/>
            </svg>
            <p>
              <strong>100% direct care:</strong> 100% of your contribution goes straight to daily colostrum formula bottles, clean straw bedding, and around-the-clock veterinary attention.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div id="success-tip-section" class="success-tip-note" style="display: none;">
            <p><strong>+ <span id="success-tip-amount">$0</span> Awareness Outreach Tip:</strong> Reaches an estimated <strong id="success-tip-reach">0</strong> citizens, building pressure in the House Agriculture Committee.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="notice" style="margin-top: var(--s3); text-align: center;">
            <p id="success-next-steps">An official confirmation receipt has been sent to <strong id="success-email">your inbox</strong>.</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--xs); color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px;">Statement descriptor: <strong>RISEHOPE</strong></p>
          </div>

          <div class="success-actions">
            <button onclick="handleShareSuccess()" class="button primary" type="button">
              <span>Share the petition</span>
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/><line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"/><line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"/></svg>
            </button>
            <button id="success-back-btn" onclick="window.location.href=document.referrer||'/'" class="button quiet" type="button">
